      "path": "app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml",
      "content": "This receiver listens for `BOOT_COMPLETED`, but the app manifest doesn't declare `android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED`. Today it still works only because WorkManager's library manifest merges that permission in. If the dependency setup changes, or someone adds `tools:node=\"remove\"`, the boot sync will stop without any error. Declare the permission here, next to the receiver that needs it.",
      "suggestion_code": "\u003cuses-permission android:name=\"android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED\" /\u003e",
